WEBVTT

00:06.141 --> 00:09.350
[The following program is a true story.]

00:09.375 --> 00:12.083
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:12.458 --> 00:14.826
[True.]

00:16.000 --> 00:20.333
[2AM - Day 3 Tet]

00:24.215 --> 00:25.547
Are you miss Pham Hoai Xuan?

00:25.735 --> 00:26.582
Yes.

00:26.844 --> 00:28.235
Sorry to bother you.

00:28.260 --> 00:29.318
My name is Long.

00:29.519 --> 00:31.619
The officer in charge of the
Ha Thi Mai investigation.

00:32.103 --> 00:34.048
I would like to confirm with you...

00:34.088 --> 00:35.863
Some facts regarding Mai’s corpse.

00:35.970 --> 00:37.847
Um... My husband is not home.

00:37.872 --> 00:40.450
I know... We already have police
monitoring him at the moment.

00:41.291 --> 00:42.750
I would like to speak privately with you.

00:44.273 --> 00:46.480
Would you mind answering some
questions for me?

01:22.633 --> 01:27.924
MISSING: EVE OF TET

01:30.447 --> 01:34.114
Episode 6: Dan

01:36.000 --> 01:39.458
[7PM - Day 4 Tet]

01:39.637 --> 01:41.387
Do you often get headaches, like me?

01:43.413 --> 01:44.537
Um...

01:45.351 --> 01:47.434
It’s been quite cold these days.

01:48.602 --> 01:49.835
I apologize in advance,

01:50.239 --> 01:51.906
in case my questions get too personal.

01:52.493 --> 01:53.719
Is your husband....

01:53.899 --> 01:55.329
is an angry person?

01:56.898 --> 01:58.038
Umm...

01:59.997 --> 02:04.274
He tends to get frustrated with me...
Because I’m so clumsy.

02:06.386 --> 02:10.856
- We also have arguments...
- In the morning you found Mai...

02:10.881 --> 02:12.048
You also had a fight?

02:12.361 --> 02:14.457
You stated that you were both
on the way home.

02:14.556 --> 02:16.252
You had an argument in the truck.

02:16.461 --> 02:19.044
- After that, he got out and made you get out...
- That’s correct.

02:19.937 --> 02:24.011
- I’m sorry. I have to make dinner.
- Just one more question!

02:25.820 --> 02:28.391
What about his friends?
Are they violent, too?

02:31.226 --> 02:35.595
The DNA we found in the second autopsy
does not match that of Nguyen Chau Bau,

02:35.620 --> 02:37.245
the suspect for Mai’s kidnapping.

02:37.341 --> 02:39.818
We still have not found a match for them.

02:39.843 --> 02:41.189
Why haven’t you?

02:41.335 --> 02:42.656
Is it that you don’t know?

02:42.736 --> 02:44.041
Or you don’t...

02:44.962 --> 02:46.337
Let him finish talking, dear.

02:47.633 --> 02:49.441
What else did you find?

02:50.221 --> 02:52.310
Mai was three months pregnant
when she died.

02:52.334 --> 02:54.275
The fetus had already developed
its arms and legs.

02:54.869 --> 02:56.394
She died from her injuries.

02:56.419 --> 02:58.549
She had sustained too much trauma
from her three rapists,

02:58.658 --> 03:01.503
which led to severe internal bleeding.

03:01.585 --> 03:06.407
Rather than being taken to the hospital,
she was strangled with a chain-like object.

03:07.387 --> 03:10.683
Thank you for you time. Now, I just
need to make a quick inspection.

03:24.627 --> 03:26.472
It smells like bleach in here.

03:27.127 --> 03:28.056
Um...

03:29.098 --> 03:32.269
We had a mold problem.
Bleach was the only way to clean it.

03:32.294 --> 03:34.758
Otherwise,
we’d have to remove all the wood.

03:44.632 --> 03:46.319
I’ve found the weapon.
Arrest them.

04:04.371 --> 04:05.434
Where’s my payment?

04:05.459 --> 04:07.162
You have to deliver first.
Afterwards, I’ll pay.

04:26.129 --> 04:28.424
Don’t worry. He’s just grumpy.

04:35.111 --> 04:36.285
Freeze!

04:37.220 --> 04:38.287
I’m innocent!

04:38.312 --> 04:39.333
I’m innocent.

04:39.358 --> 04:40.442
I’m innocent!

04:40.467 --> 04:41.309
I’m innocent!

04:41.334 --> 04:42.311
I’m innocent!

04:42.336 --> 04:43.513
I came to fix my bike.

04:43.802 --> 04:45.658
Officers, I was getting my bike fixed!

04:45.712 --> 04:46.766
I’m innocent!

04:47.046 --> 04:48.394
I was only fixing my bike!

04:48.419 --> 04:49.502
I was only fixing my bike!

04:49.527 --> 04:51.089
Please! I was just fixing my bike!

04:51.367 --> 04:52.470
I’m innocent!

04:52.781 --> 04:53.947
Shut your damn mouth!

04:56.455 --> 04:57.910
Bring them back to the station!

04:58.137 --> 05:00.207
- Go!
- I’m telling you. I’m innocent.

05:00.232 --> 05:01.886
- I’m innocent! I’m innocent!
- Go!

05:01.911 --> 05:04.480
I’m innocent! I’m innocent!

05:04.548 --> 05:08.266
Everyone! I’m an innocent man!
Look, everyone...! I’m innocent!

05:08.291 --> 05:09.603
Coming live to you at 9pm.

05:09.628 --> 05:13.002
We just received exciting information
from Miss HTM's closed case.

05:13.027 --> 05:16.040
I’m innocent! They arrested me,
but I am innocent!

05:16.065 --> 05:16.981
How could you do that?

05:17.181 --> 05:19.016
Why would you hide Mai’s pregnancy from me?

05:19.041 --> 05:20.516
Don’t I deserve to know?

05:20.541 --> 05:21.860
It had nothing to do with you!

05:21.885 --> 05:23.429
I was trying to protect Mai!

05:23.454 --> 05:25.600
The fewer people who know,
the better it is to keep her reputation!

05:25.625 --> 05:27.743
- Don’t you get it?
- But I am Mai’s father!

05:27.768 --> 05:29.462
Have you ever been able to keep a secret?

05:29.487 --> 05:30.502
Secrets...

05:33.297 --> 05:35.538
I’m so tired of your secrets.

05:35.563 --> 05:37.938
I’m your husband.
Why would you keep secrets from me?

05:37.963 --> 05:38.991
Why?

05:39.016 --> 05:41.366
Don’t think that I don’t know
about your secret with Mai!

05:41.484 --> 05:43.104
You’re still addicted to alcohol!

05:43.249 --> 05:45.609
You’re hiding it inside the feeder,
in the chicken coop!

05:45.634 --> 05:47.519
You secretly made a deal with Bau!

05:47.544 --> 05:49.608
That junkie who helped
kidnapped your daughter!

05:49.911 --> 05:52.514
My secrets protect this family!

05:52.773 --> 05:54.523
What good are yours?

06:01.723 --> 06:02.742
I’m...

06:02.946 --> 06:05.305
I’m sorry, Dad.

06:07.822 --> 06:09.114
You did nothing wrong, honey.

06:09.882 --> 06:12.340
Mom and I are fighting over something else.

06:13.630 --> 06:14.966
Is it because...

06:15.169 --> 06:16.961
I was keeping the secret...

06:17.267 --> 06:18.309
For Mom?

06:19.531 --> 06:22.357
About Mom having another phone?

06:32.939 --> 06:34.314
Do you recognize these?

06:38.608 --> 06:39.806
What are they?

06:44.406 --> 06:46.339
The chain-links on this weapon...

06:47.064 --> 06:48.856
match with the traces's shape
in the victim's neck.

06:49.509 --> 06:50.803
Explain it to me.

06:51.181 --> 06:53.195
Why was this weapon in your home?

06:55.171 --> 06:56.584
Are you joking?

07:00.767 --> 07:04.763
These evidences...
You planted in my home

07:05.726 --> 07:07.063
to the guilt

07:07.515 --> 07:09.346
to extort a confession, right?

07:11.922 --> 07:14.375
Save these tricks for Bau.

07:15.942 --> 07:16.685
What?

07:17.619 --> 07:19.995
You think that you can scare me
with that mad dog look?

07:22.411 --> 07:24.420
I’m a transport driver.

07:25.414 --> 07:28.875
Clients pay me to pick up
and drop off goods.

07:29.411 --> 07:31.145
My wife can be my witness.

07:32.557 --> 07:35.158
I have nothing to do with your weapon.

07:37.158 --> 07:39.234
Save these gimmicks for someone else.

07:41.325 --> 07:43.339
This fish won’t take the bait.

07:43.984 --> 07:45.503
Then where were you on New Year’s Eve?

07:45.937 --> 07:47.020
With my wife.

07:47.288 --> 07:48.579
She’ll testify.

07:51.059 --> 07:52.949
You have her in custody, right?

07:54.088 --> 07:55.297
Go ask her.

07:59.859 --> 08:01.543
Your case weak.

08:04.450 --> 08:05.533
I’m innocent.

08:08.103 --> 08:09.347
Release me!

08:10.447 --> 08:12.908
Mai’s DNA was all over the weapon.

08:13.731 --> 08:15.175
You are not innocent.

08:17.017 --> 08:18.881
You wanna kiss me?

08:20.296 --> 08:21.805
Or do you wanna punch me?

08:26.653 --> 08:27.445
Hit me!

08:28.458 --> 08:29.375
Go on, hit me!

08:31.728 --> 08:32.789
Hit me!

08:34.513 --> 08:36.725
Give me a reason to sue your ass!

08:52.059 --> 08:53.766
- She’s one of them, too!
- Auntie!

08:53.791 --> 08:56.308
You kept my daughter locked up!
You think you can just walk free?

08:56.333 --> 08:57.106
Auntie, calm down! Auntie!

08:57.130 --> 08:59.138
You killed my daughter!
I’m going to kill you!

08:59.163 --> 09:02.333
- Auntie! Don’t do this!
- Stop! Don’t you dare leave!

09:02.358 --> 09:04.497
Stop or I have to arrest you
for assaulting her!

09:04.522 --> 09:05.356
Arrest me?

09:05.381 --> 09:07.725
What reason do you have to arrest me?
You should arrest her for lying!

09:07.750 --> 09:09.545
- Auntie!
- I told you to reopen the case...

09:09.570 --> 09:11.112
So that you can
arrest all of those bastards!

09:11.137 --> 09:12.659
You’re a disgrace to Mai!

09:12.848 --> 09:14.808
You’re defending Xuan and Dan!

09:14.833 --> 09:17.377
You failed to find Bau’s DNA
on Mai’s body!

09:17.402 --> 09:18.562
Now he might go free!

09:18.587 --> 09:20.589
You have wronged Mai worse than them!

09:20.621 --> 09:21.913
And what would you have me do?

09:22.922 --> 09:23.878
What, Auntie?

09:24.650 --> 09:27.711
I have done everything you ask
since the day Mai went missing!

09:28.509 --> 09:29.810
But it’s never enough.

09:30.775 --> 09:32.248
I need concrete evidence!

09:32.891 --> 09:34.311
That's the law!

09:34.849 --> 09:38.191
It’s to protect innocent people like
you and uncle from going to jail!

09:40.677 --> 09:42.791
I have done everything by the book.

09:44.140 --> 09:45.481
What more do you want?

09:45.506 --> 09:47.176
I want all those bastards to die...

09:47.201 --> 09:48.848
For killing Mai
and the baby inside her belly!

09:48.872 --> 09:49.753
That’s enough!

10:03.254 --> 10:04.514
I’m sorry, Uncle.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.761
I had no idea that Mai was pregnant.

10:10.669 --> 10:11.961
I also just found out.

10:13.228 --> 10:14.898
Your Auntie never said a word to anyone.

10:15.672 --> 10:17.197
What do you plan to do now?

10:19.372 --> 10:21.221
I’m certain that Dan is the
one who killed Mai.

10:22.109 --> 10:24.238
His wife was the one who found Mai’s body.

10:25.189 --> 10:28.734
His cargo truck is the ideal
vehicle for kidnapping her.

10:29.684 --> 10:31.434
He has a history of violence.

10:31.895 --> 10:34.727
We caught him in the middle of a drug run.

10:36.547 --> 10:37.838
Not to mention...

10:38.876 --> 10:40.918
The weapon that we found at his home...

10:41.186 --> 10:43.237
Matches the marks found on Mai’s neck.

10:46.598 --> 10:47.699
Uncle...

10:49.119 --> 10:50.621
What more proof do you need?

10:51.031 --> 10:52.930
Don’t you have enough to
arrest that bastard?

10:53.431 --> 10:55.258
All of the evidence are circumstantial.

10:56.669 --> 10:58.289
Even with the heroin.

10:58.624 --> 11:00.709
He claims not to know what
he was transporting.

11:02.124 --> 11:05.065
We have nothing that concretely
ties him to the crimes.

11:07.127 --> 11:09.052
Unless Xuan corroborates the charges,

11:09.996 --> 11:11.626
we cannot prosecute him.

11:15.353 --> 11:16.145
Uncle!

11:26.822 --> 11:28.306
[Rapist]

12:30.538 --> 12:32.127
My wife and I...

12:32.152 --> 12:34.321
Having Mai was an accident.

12:35.098 --> 12:36.587
That’s what Hoa always says.

12:37.399 --> 12:39.130
But I don’t think agree.

12:39.476 --> 12:41.523
My wife is a very smart woman.

12:42.351 --> 12:43.661
Very strong.

12:43.686 --> 12:48.159
She often has a hot temper...
Careless with words.

12:51.008 --> 12:53.286
I know that in this town...

12:54.238 --> 12:56.898
People talk a lot about
me and my family.

12:59.185 --> 13:01.563
Folks around here can be cruel.

13:05.363 --> 13:06.474
They don’t really...

13:06.692 --> 13:08.567
See the woman that I see.

13:12.517 --> 13:13.767
They don’t know her.

13:15.706 --> 13:18.456
To me, she is so beautiful,

13:19.583 --> 13:20.868
good,

13:21.236 --> 13:22.611
loves her family to death.

13:26.353 --> 13:28.145
She gave me two daughters,

13:28.999 --> 13:30.749
who are bright and beautiful.

13:35.758 --> 13:37.142
After Mai disappeared...

13:40.812 --> 13:41.937
my wife....

13:43.415 --> 13:44.999
she became someone else.

13:46.752 --> 13:50.759
Everything that I had loved about her...

13:51.148 --> 13:52.731
Completely changed.

13:58.469 --> 14:01.094
Her words became... Toxic...

14:03.931 --> 14:06.431
They hurt my daughter and I very much.

14:09.877 --> 14:11.518
But those words she said...

14:13.986 --> 14:15.567
can never be taken back.

14:24.356 --> 14:26.231
I first met Dan...

14:28.822 --> 14:31.156
when he had already been
a truck driver.

14:34.424 --> 14:36.216
My village was near the border.

14:38.942 --> 14:41.442
It was on his delivery route.

14:43.028 --> 14:44.492
My family was very poor.

14:46.192 --> 14:49.025
That’s why I never had a proper
education, like other kids.

14:51.519 --> 14:53.353
So when he proposed to me,

14:53.950 --> 14:55.486
my parents was quick to give me away.

14:56.473 --> 14:58.926
They wanted to rid themself...

14:58.981 --> 15:00.148
of their uneducated,

15:00.807 --> 15:04.005
and useless girl as quick as possible

15:04.205 --> 15:05.622
to have one less mouth to feed.

15:10.541 --> 15:11.750
Me, too...

15:12.666 --> 15:16.153
Every time that I need to read
or understand something,

15:17.218 --> 15:19.478
I have to ask my wife or daughter to do it.

15:23.828 --> 15:26.210
My husband and I have been
wanting to have a child,

15:28.296 --> 15:29.629
but haven’t been able to.

15:31.856 --> 15:33.231
5 years ago...

15:33.957 --> 15:37.399
I’ve asked him to go to a clinic,
to find a way to get pregnant.

15:38.939 --> 15:40.658
He would never agree to it,

15:41.184 --> 15:43.851
because those things cost
a lot of money.

15:44.853 --> 15:46.307
But suddenly...

15:46.333 --> 15:47.707
he agreed to go.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.455
What did the doctor say?

16:00.731 --> 16:02.145
I was grateful to him.

16:04.708 --> 16:05.958
When he told me...

16:07.634 --> 16:09.173
that he wouldn’t leave me.

16:11.812 --> 16:14.503
Because I am the one
who can’t have babies.

16:18.554 --> 16:20.512
At that moment, I felt...

16:21.197 --> 16:23.239
That I still had someone who needed me.

16:32.760 --> 16:34.445
But then recently...

16:36.824 --> 16:40.089
I found out that everything that
he had told me was a lie.

16:41.430 --> 16:43.555
Dan is the one who is infertile.

16:45.582 --> 16:48.332
What good would it do to get mad?
Leave him?

16:49.492 --> 16:50.915
Where would I go?

16:58.479 --> 17:01.007
Living under another’s shadow is hard.

17:02.890 --> 17:05.848
Especially someone who is better you.

17:09.103 --> 17:10.770
My wife is the same.

17:14.348 --> 17:15.857
Whenever she’s happy....

17:16.189 --> 17:18.064
the whole family is warmed by her light!

17:20.349 --> 17:22.516
But then this hatred...

17:23.536 --> 17:26.623
turned her dark and cold.

17:28.805 --> 17:31.721
She turned
the whole neighborhood against us.

17:37.016 --> 17:37.975
At first...

17:39.019 --> 17:40.811
It was only the search for Mai.

17:42.558 --> 17:44.058
But then the hatred...

17:46.016 --> 17:47.422
Made her into...

17:48.022 --> 17:49.998
A vengeful person.

17:53.433 --> 17:54.808
But that’s my wife.

17:56.850 --> 17:57.951
As for me,

17:58.269 --> 18:00.727
would revenge bring Mai back to life?

18:10.266 --> 18:11.558
Now I just want...

18:15.683 --> 18:18.141
know about Mai’s last moments...

18:21.183 --> 18:22.725
to be next to her

18:23.266 --> 18:24.975
to comfort her.

18:25.371 --> 18:28.541
And mourn with her,
for the dead baby in her belly.

18:50.301 --> 18:51.755
You have your reasons...

18:52.704 --> 18:54.454
to protect your husband.

18:55.917 --> 18:58.752
I would never ask you to turn him in.

19:04.813 --> 19:06.796
I just wanted to know
my daughter’s last thoughts,

19:10.165 --> 19:11.874
As she laid dying...

19:12.933 --> 19:14.683
was she in a lot of pain?

19:18.029 --> 19:19.687
Was she scared?

19:20.683 --> 19:22.308
Was she lonely?

19:25.404 --> 19:27.463
Did she know that my whole family...

19:27.738 --> 19:30.781
never gave up looking for her?

19:42.300 --> 19:44.717
Never been the most beautiful person

19:45.647 --> 19:49.033
Never been the gentlest person
in the room, and they...

19:49.058 --> 19:55.228
Never look into your eyes at first

19:55.479 --> 19:58.104
Never been the most important person

19:58.805 --> 20:02.200
Never been the everyone looks
forward to seeing and they...

20:02.225 --> 20:08.177
Never make conversation with you first

20:08.331 --> 20:10.552
This wall...

20:11.240 --> 20:14.950
Grows thicker everyday

20:14.975 --> 20:17.141
This bed...

20:17.766 --> 20:21.333
- Is just a single bed
- Xuan!

20:21.367 --> 20:22.494
Why do you come back here?

20:22.810 --> 20:23.706
What do you gonna do?

20:23.731 --> 20:25.220
Xuan! Xuan!

20:25.245 --> 20:27.685
How you dare! Xuan!

20:27.819 --> 20:29.567
Xuan! What are you doing?

20:31.016 --> 20:34.701
That I am very difficult to love

20:35.194 --> 20:38.408
When we are on the same path

20:38.433 --> 20:41.464
I have loved you for a long time

20:41.489 --> 20:44.158
I hope that you understand

20:44.183 --> 20:51.126
That I am very difficult to love...

20:51.344 --> 20:54.803
[8AM - Day 6 Tet]

20:58.061 --> 21:01.257
These are the felons that we
arrested along with Dan.

21:02.422 --> 21:04.199
Do you recognize any of them, Auntie?

21:04.605 --> 21:08.838
Among these felons is Mai Van Co,
who was just released last week.

21:09.366 --> 21:12.038
He had been serving a sentence
for trafficking drugs.

21:12.100 --> 21:13.887
Can you identify him, Auntie?

21:19.102 --> 21:20.056
What’s wrong, Auntie?

21:20.930 --> 21:22.604
Did you recognized Mai Van Co?

21:24.063 --> 21:25.253
It’s not that.

21:26.196 --> 21:28.651
It’s just... I was thinking about Mai.

21:28.859 --> 21:30.665
The child she was carrying.

21:33.921 --> 21:35.610
I’m sorry for troubling you.

21:37.235 --> 21:39.607
For asking you to be here
on the day of Mai’s funeral.

21:42.413 --> 21:43.531
If you’re too tired,

21:43.773 --> 21:45.157
then you can go home.

21:49.647 --> 21:51.047
The identification...

21:52.417 --> 21:53.766
what’s it for?

21:54.553 --> 21:55.871
It’s like you said.

21:56.815 --> 21:59.371
The person responsible for
Mai’s death is still out there.

21:59.780 --> 22:01.728
He is the main link in the chain.

22:02.585 --> 22:05.563
If you can pick him out from one
of these felons in the line up,

22:05.629 --> 22:07.635
then I will have the authority
to dig deeper

22:07.659 --> 22:10.818
into the investigation to catch them all.

22:11.870 --> 22:15.882
We will not stop until we have caught
every single one of them. I promise you!

22:33.415 --> 22:35.115
If I don’t recognize any of them,

22:36.029 --> 22:37.361
then what happens?

22:39.680 --> 22:41.162
Then I can’t hold them.

22:42.350 --> 22:43.725
They will go free.

22:57.717 --> 22:59.110
I don’t recognize anyone.

24:25.930 --> 24:26.836
Uncle.

24:30.711 --> 24:31.878
Thank you, Tien.

24:36.811 --> 24:38.535
The flowers are beautiful.

24:41.477 --> 24:42.811
Where’s Auntie, Uncle?

24:44.370 --> 24:47.453
Long called her to the station
to help him with some business.

24:47.737 --> 24:49.486
Why didn’t you go with her?

24:52.839 --> 24:55.294
Your aunt doesn’t like anyone
tagging along with her.

24:56.429 --> 24:57.600
Also...

25:01.558 --> 25:02.725
I have to be home,

25:03.178 --> 25:06.386
and prepare everything,
before they bring Mai home.

25:09.714 --> 25:11.251
You should rest a little, Uncle.

25:55.514 --> 25:56.809
I’m on my way down...

25:57.272 --> 25:58.230
Just park outside.

25:58.649 --> 26:00.566
Keep the engine running.
I’m coming down now.

26:01.425 --> 26:02.500
Officers.

27:06.541 --> 27:07.950
- You dog!
- Are you crazy?

27:07.975 --> 27:09.433
I don’t have a grudge with you!

27:09.475 --> 27:10.583
Shut your damn mouth!

27:10.608 --> 27:11.619
I’m sorry!

27:11.858 --> 27:14.499
You’re sorry? I don’t need
your fucking apologies!

27:14.577 --> 27:15.950
I just want to kill you!

27:15.975 --> 27:17.158
You’re still blaming me?

27:17.183 --> 27:20.029
You were the one who borrowed
500 mil from me in the first place!

27:20.054 --> 27:21.346
I trafficked your drugs!

27:21.371 --> 27:22.758
Did 12 years for you!

27:22.790 --> 27:24.300
I’m the one who should kill you!

27:24.389 --> 27:25.518
Fuck you!

27:25.695 --> 27:26.672
Fuck you!

27:27.397 --> 27:28.841
Why are you telling that story?

27:28.896 --> 27:29.656
Fuck you!

27:29.800 --> 27:32.222
Don’t you deserve a beating?
You killed my daughter!

27:32.771 --> 27:35.593
All I took was your money!
What you took was my daughter’s life!

27:41.688 --> 27:44.123
You robbed me... Of 12 years!

27:44.198 --> 27:46.742
I also lost my life!

27:48.248 --> 27:51.533
I will show you what it’s like
to lose everything!

27:51.558 --> 27:52.282
Auntie!

27:52.307 --> 27:53.162
Stop!

27:53.678 --> 27:54.830
What are you doing?

27:56.058 --> 27:56.891
Save me!

27:57.294 --> 27:58.281
Please save me!

27:58.306 --> 27:59.218
Stop it!

27:59.808 --> 28:00.705
Help me!

28:00.878 --> 28:01.944
Help me please!

28:04.781 --> 28:05.917
Go on kill me!

28:05.942 --> 28:07.439
Kill me. Go on and kill me.

28:08.151 --> 28:09.151
Officers...

28:09.176 --> 28:11.461
- Officers...
- Co!

28:11.486 --> 28:13.336
MISSING: EVE OF TET
